sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant App as Flask App
    participant Plaid as Plaid Service
    participant PlaidAPI as Plaid API
    participant DB as Database

    User->>App: Request to link bank account
    App->>Plaid: Create link token
    Plaid->>PlaidAPI: Request link token
    PlaidAPI-->>Plaid: Return link token
    Plaid-->>App: Forward link token
    App-->>User: Display Plaid Link UI with token

    User->>User: Authenticate with bank
    User->>App: Submit public token
    App->>Plaid: Exchange public token for access token
    Plaid->>PlaidAPI: Send token exchange request
    PlaidAPI-->>Plaid: Return access token
    Plaid-->>App: Forward access token

    App->>DB: Store access token with user
    App->>Plaid: Sync account balances
    Plaid->>PlaidAPI: Request account data
    PlaidAPI-->>Plaid: Return account data
    Plaid->>DB: Store account data

    App->>Plaid: Sync transactions
    Plaid->>PlaidAPI: Request transaction data
    PlaidAPI-->>Plaid: Return transaction data
    Plaid->>DB: Store transaction data

    App-->>User: Display connected accounts dashboard